# ✅ HEVC Data class

```kotlin
data class HevcSpsData(
    val width: Int,
    val height: Int,
    val profileSpace: Int,
    val tierFlag: Boolean,
    val profileIdc: Int,
    val bitDepthLuma: Int,
    val bitDepthChroma: Int,
    val chromaFormatIdc: Int
)
```

---

# ✅ So sánh đúng chuẩn HEVC

```kotlin
fun HevcSpsData.isCodecCompatible(other: HevcSpsData): Boolean {
    return width == other.width &&
           height == other.height &&
           profileSpace == other.profileSpace &&
           tierFlag == other.tierFlag &&
           profileIdc == other.profileIdc &&
           bitDepthLuma == other.bitDepthLuma &&
           bitDepthChroma == other.bitDepthChroma &&
           chromaFormatIdc == other.chromaFormatIdc
}
```

